    isbefore: []  # 3b7c
    duplicate_of: []  # 3b7c
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 3b7c
    pr_ref:  # 3b7c
    description: "Introduce NewType aliases for identifier-bearing fields: StableId, NodeId, EdgeId, ConfigFingerprint, etc. Pair each with a canonical factory function (compute_stable_id, make_node_id, etc.) that's the only entry point for constructing the NewType. Refactor emitters that currently use raw str for these fields. Closes some INV-kurup canonical-factory-bypass sub-cases at type-check time — direct str → NewType assignment becomes a type error, forcing the call site through the factory. Also closes part of INV-lidul (config_fingerprint constant) — the factory can refuse to construct a fingerprint from an empty config dict."  # 3b7c
    fields: {}  # 3b7c
