  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool3/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at 100b6fbb6e: NewType has 0 uses in packages/*/src. INV-lidul was satisfied 2026-06-17 via fingerprint stamping (PR #271), not NewType, and compute_config_fingerprint({}) still returns sha256:44136fa355b3678a (no refusing factory). INV-kurup's Symbol.id/Edge.id bypasses now have a static lint (scripts/check-id-construction, WI-vodin, in pre-commit). The INV-lidul rationale is void; re-scope to fields that lint does not cover. MECHANISM: identifiers typed as raw str so factory bypass is not a type error. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-kurup,WI-totov."  # 5556
